===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[parking]] [[ticket]]}}

# a [[legal]] [[summons]] issued for [[park]]ing in a [[restricted]] [[place]], or beyond the time paid for.
# a small ticket purchased from a [[ticket machine]] in a [[car park]], on which the expiry time is printed.

